      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4354939644210601516, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Roomprefab
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.name
      value: Player
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.size
      value: 20
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[0].sentence
      value: "A lightsaber. For your very suspicious friend. I really hope It doesn\u2019t end up cutting your throat."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[1].sentence
      value: Thank you. I consider you a true friend.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[2].sentence
      value: "As do I, you. You\u2019re a pretty\u2026 Interesting guy. Where do you come from?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[3].sentence
      value: ' I am so glad you asked.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[4].sentence
      value: Oh boy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[5].sentence
      value: My family background is a clerical lineage dating back to the 16th century. I represent the final branch of this family, which is of farming stock. My ancestral surname is Westzynthius. My roots include the Jaftuja family of Lippiduui, the Trolgetron family from Blirboland, and the Tinky Winky clerical family; this makes me a representative of two educated families and three farming families.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[6].sentence
      value: "Huh. Pretty interesting stuff. It\u2019s cool how far we\u2019ve come from our original ancestors."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[7].sentence
      value: Agreed. If you really think about it, we are result of million loves, past 400 years we have had over 4000 thousand people that have needed to exist for us to exist here today, everyone of these people have had their stories of love and grief, victories and losses, successes and failures. and their hopes and dreams of our ancestors is that we can exist here today, and same will go to our children and their children, this is endless of most beautiful and most wonderful. who we are to whine of our inevitable return to that prior state where most have never stirred up form.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[8].sentence
      value: Cool. Have you ever tried pursuing poetry?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[9].sentence
      value: 'Descartes demon I solved that by choice. I chose to trust my instincts and I chose this continous existence that i remember to be reality.  '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[10].sentence
      value: 'Can we go back to the guy who wants to kill you? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[11].sentence
      value: 'Ship of theseus. no matter how much of it is changed, as the entity of ship of theseus will continue until the entity ceases completely through total ceasation as any gradual change just makes new planks to be part of theseus. the spatiotemporal continuity the entity that remains constant regardless of the material flux. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[12].sentence
      value: 'You lost me. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[13].sentence
      value: ' I also have capacity of total dreamcontrol to point choosing what i dream and what happens in dream conciously. and i used that age age of 11 to give nightmare entity an humanoid shape to beat it up with my dream fists. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[14].sentence
      value: "I see you\u2019ve been thinking very hard about all this. How come? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[15].sentence
      value: "Yeah sorry, I do that sometimes. I\u2019m an INTP, you see. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[16].sentence
      value: "Riiiiight. That explains. Well\u2026 I guess I\u2019ll be seeing you. And you aren\u2019t going to be dead. Hopefully.\r "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[17].sentence
      value: 'HA! Like that would happen. I trust everyone in my life with my life. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[18].sentence
      value: "Haha\u2026 Yup. Be seeing you! Hopefully!! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[19].sentence
      value: You too, friend!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7968387475252959001, guid: 3fd148b7692c7134dba83b213cd75b37, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.lines.Array.data[0].nextEvent.m_PersistentCalls.m_Calls.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
